				"description": "Method: GET  \nEndpoint: /onboarding/ariel  \nExample URL:\n\n[https://kyaijofl1c.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/preview/onboarding_ariel](https://kyaijofl1c.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/preview/onboarding_ariel)\n\nPath Parameter: ariel (string, required)\n\nHeaders:  \nContent-Type: application/json  \nAuthorization: Bearer (optional)\n\nBody: none\n\nResponse Format: JSON  \nResponse Example:  \n{  \n\"name\": \"Ariel\",  \n\"self_intro\": \"Hi! I'm Ariel, part of the 8th Tech cohort, and I will be joining the TPET team as a backend developer. I enjoy listening to K-pop and playing the piano. Looking forward to working with everyone!\"  \n}"
